<title>UK: Large buy order helps Blue Circle shares.</title>
<headline>Large buy order helps Blue Circle shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Blue Circle Industries were pushed higher on Wednesday as a large buyer emerged and marketmakers started to fall short of stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shares were 19p higher at 382-1/2p by 1230 GMT. Over 5.1 million shares had been traded.</p>
<p>&quot;There was a big buyer in the market and people are starting to get wind of it,&quot; said one dealer. &quot;Its caught a few people by surprise.&quot;</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
